        "title": "Rhetoric - Overview and Landscape",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "1. INVENTIO (invention/discovery of arguments)\n   Finding what there is to say.\n   Not making up arguments from nothing but discovering\n   what arguments are available for this case and audience.\n   The \"topics\" (topoi/loci communes): general lines of\n   argument applicable to many cases.\n   See 03-FIVE-CANONS.md for full treatment."
    },
    {
      "id": "00-OVERVIEW.md#021",
      "path": [
        "00-OVERVIEW.md"
      ],
