        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Rhetoric - Overview and Landscape",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "2. DISPOSITIO (arrangement/organization)\n   Ordering the material for maximum effect.\n   Classical arrangement: exordium (introduction) + narratio\n   (statement of facts) + confirmatio (arguments) + refutatio\n   (handling objections) + peroratio (conclusion).\n   Modern: what goes first, middle, last? Why?\n   See 03-FIVE-CANONS.md."
    },
    {
