        "title": "Rhetoric - Overview and Landscape",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "3. ELOCUTIO (style/expression)\n   How to say it: word choice, sentence structure, figures.\n   Four virtues of style (Theophrastus):\n     Grammaticality, clarity, ornamentation, propriety.\n   The \"plain/middle/grand\" style levels.\n   See 04-FIGURES-OF-SPEECH.md for figures."
    },
