        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Rhetoric - Overview and Landscape",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nPROFESSIONAL RHETORICAL OCCASIONS\n-----------------------------------\nDELIBERATIVE:\n  - Strategy presentations to senior leadership\n  - Budget justification documents\n  - Hiring decisions presented to the staffing committee\n  - Roadmap presentations (what should we build next?)\n  - Technical decision documents (\"should we adopt X?\")\n  → Inventio: what are the arguments? What does this\n    audience care about? What objections will arise?\n  → Dispositio: bottom-line up front, or story arc first?\n  → Ethos: why should they trust your recommendation?"
    },
    {
      "id": "00-OVERVIEW.md#033",
      "path": [
        "00-OVERVIEW.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
