        "title": "Rhetoric - Overview and Landscape",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "EPIDEICTIC:\n  - Team all-hands celebrating a launch\n  - Award speech for an exceptional engineer\n  - Eulogy for a colleague\n  - Commencement-style talk at an onboarding event\n  - Toast at a team dinner\n  → Templates in 07-EPIDEICTIC.md"
    },
