      "text": "TOULMIN IN PRACTICE:\n  Every design review document is a Toulmin argument.\n  Every pull request description is a Toulmin argument.\n  Every RFC (Request for Comments) is a Toulmin argument.\n  → See 05-ARGUMENTATION.md for the full model.\n```"
